{"v":4,"catch":"用像素畫出漂亮的圖畫！","desc":"Paint by Pixel 是一款輕鬆的益智遊戲，您可以一次一個像素地創作精美的藝術作品。 \n選擇畫筆或填充模式，重新著色您的繪圖以使其個性化，並使用縮放和放大鏡來關注細節。\n遊戲還包括自動填充功能和提示，讓事情變得更容易。  Paint by Pixel 有 95 個關卡可供選擇，是放鬆和探索藝術方面的完美遊戲。\n\n- 從 95 件美麗的藝術品中選擇！\n- 選擇並玩任意關卡！\n- 可自訂的顏色！\n- 優美的配樂！\n- 縮放和放大，輕鬆玩耍！","publisher":"Ocean Media","release":"2024-09-26","genres":["益智","學習","桌上遊戲"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","德文","荷蘭文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3bc169a3fcaa92ec1513d66d9c6b8ecd98916870e05f2ac4e5ce0d30af5b74a9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e794055cd3e849f162be87cb27b7cf7dc091936f7b90e3c88e28a7419c46eb82.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4dec6d595d75697723b937c5aa0f5809aa81e79956ea3564cc0797e2436f0abc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ad07503dc44b9b211136c34f64ff77d9ec667c31d52c1dfc846f31cdcfa25f89.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/965bf136eafd677b2168d16fde067401228ebf4f7da50a695660403e343b27d2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/07d0a375536c918d0bcb1d6bf263e0f43d80e72662d21eb68c40c094e1315490.jpg"],"titleId":"01006bf01c980000","dlc":[]}